 "description": "<p>Ten tongue-licking frequencies in a rose-bud egg, aimed at the nipple-clitoral pair by the high-frequency motor underneath. The bud's tongue mimics the real contact the category chases, oscillating against the clitoris with the precision a wider head loses.</p>\n<p><img alt=\"Tongue_Orgasm_Rose_Vibrating_Egg_1\" src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0772/6311/0453/files/3_9063bb64-007c-475f-92d9-3c282e5764a5_480x480.jpg?v=1701826112\"></p>\n<p>Under 50 dB the motor stays in the quiet band through all ten frequencies. The 83 by 56 millimeter body is the pocket class — portable in the genuine sense, and the shipping packaging is discreet without explicit text, as the listing specifies.</p>\n<p><img alt=\"Tongue_Orgasm_Rose_Vibrating_Egg_2\" src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0772/6311/0453/files/5_31a870d2-71b9-448d-a641-a494a8852227_480x480.jpg?v=1701826134\"></p>\n<p>USB magnetic charging returns about an hour of use per full charge. The waterproof body handles showers and hot-tub edges with the listed caveat about avoiding prolonged soaking — the sensible boundary, stated rather than discovered.</p>\n<p><img alt=\"Tongue_Orgasm_Rose_Vibrating_Egg_3\" src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0772/6311/0453/files/6_14bff717-8364-4baa-8e69-4b5195f2042a_480x480.jpg?v=1701826155\"></p>\n<ul>\n<li>Tongue modes: 10 frequencies</li>\n<li>Size: 83 x 56 mm</li>\n<li>Noise: under 50 dB</li>\n<li>Battery: USB magnetic, ~1 h use</li>\n<li>Waterproof: shower-safe</li>\n<li>Packaging: discreet, unlabeled</li>\n</ul>\n<p><img alt=\"Tongue_Orgasm_Rose_Vibrating_Egg_4\" src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0772/6311/0453/files/2_13f967bf-d884-4550-ad80-5eb37745f600_480x480.jpg?v=1701826171\"><br />\n<img alt=\"Tongue_Orgasm_Rose_Vibrating_Egg_5\" src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0772/6311/0453/files/4_bb391c48-4a75-4ea8-9975-58deda1275e1_480x480.jpg?v=1701826190\"></p>\n<p>The tongue egg — pocket-sized, precisely aimed, honestly caveated.</p>\n",
